# Cursor AI Assistant Rules for Medical Guideline Project

## Project Overview
This is a medical guideline project with:
- Flutter mobile app in `/flutter/medicalguideline/`
- Python RAG backend in `/rag/`

## Performance Optimization Rules
- Ignore large build artifacts and cache directories
- Focus on source code files only (.dart, .py, .yaml, .json)
- Avoid processing binary files and large assets
- Limit file watching to essential directories

## File Processing Preferences
- Primary focus: /flutter/medicalguideline/lib/ (Dart source)
- Secondary focus: /rag/ (Python source, excluding venv)
- Exclude: build/, .dart_tool/, venv/, *.png, *.jpg, *.pdf

## Coding Standards
- Flutter: Follow Dart/Flutter conventions
- Python: Follow PEP 8 standards
- Use meaningful variable names and comments
- Maintain clean architecture patterns
